    <string name="protocol_title">User Notice and Permissions</string>
    <string name="protocol_agree">Agree and Continue</string>
    <string name="protocol_exit">Disagree and Exit</string>

    <string name="user_notice">[User Notice]\n\n1. FloatAI supports Android 8.0+ (API 26+).\n\n2. The float window requires the Display over other apps permission.\n\n3. Process viewing requires Shizuku / Dhizuku authorization.\n\n4. The AI feature requires you to configure the provider API URL and key. This app does not store any model or chat data.\n\n5. Use this app in compliance with local laws and regulations.\n\n6. This app is open-source under the MIT License. Use at your own risk.</string>

    <string name="permission_notice">[Permissions]\n\nThis app requests the following permissions:\n\n Display over other apps -- for the AI float window.\n Foreground service (FOREGROUND_SERVICE / DATA_SYNC) -- to keep the float window alive.\n Post notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS) -- for the float window service.\n Internet (INTERNET) -- to call the AI provider API.\n Access network state (ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE) -- to check network availability.\n\nFor process viewing, additional authorization is needed:\n\n Shizuku -- provides ADB-level permissions to read process info.\n Dhizuku -- alternative for non-root devices.\n\nPlease confirm that you understand the risks before granting any permission.</string>

